Package: libqore-onnx-dev
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: libprotobuf-dev, ${misc:Depends}
Description: private static ONNX development library for Qore dependencies
 ONNX provides a portable model format for machine learning. This package
 contains a private static build of ONNX for the Qore ONNX Runtime backport.
 .
 Headers, CMake metadata and libraries live in a separate prefix and use
 the qore_onnx C++ namespace. Debian's system ONNX and PyTorch libraries
 are unchanged. No Python bindings or shared libraries are installed.
